{"version":1,"key":"card:217","content":{"id":217,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c58c1d9e-beb2-4766-996c-364284768a5b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"DataView"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 读取 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ArrayBuffer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的内容是没有任何限制的，可以随便的读取，可能造成问题，另外 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"DataView"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 暴露的接口过于底层，难以使用。定型数组解决这个问题，可以认为定型数组是一个带了类型预设的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"DataView"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，并且提供了很多与一般数组相同的方法，易于使用。定型数组包括："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"df173544-db79-47cc-8c1f-f3127b172903","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"35eb1d24-386c-4943-a938-0174c0ce2c0b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f2aefa8a-c135-48c8-b9af-46d53410d208","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Int8Array"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3921318b-cf68-45e9-9711-a9a3515e54ab","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c51e7496-d382-4b88-bcc7-00bf1384d91e","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Uint8Array"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b867f354-f6d5-4a06-9ac8-76a72acdc40d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f90b4c06-e346-46aa-bab9-800bcf119abc","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Int16Array"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"79d24ed2-fe7c-4b05-853b-df7713afeaea","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6d1c8fab-850f-41f2-8cd7-9c8e7e33faf7","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Uint16Array"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e78cd900-4b2d-458a-9c87-c755ede1923c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2fefa968-c126-4673-af3c-99ed7a84a355","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Int32Array"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"de5469d6-da92-4ad5-bb27-76477776bab2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"78514205-bcc0-43d5-8863-5395456ca89b","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Uint32Array"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"622310fe-8cda-418a-abc0-0d9336e43bcd","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4f1ef912-1669-4180-8376-23c663711b1c","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Float32Array"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b6cf6e43-b8f3-45de-a023-5d94b5e170a1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"159449c6-1e2d-4778-8794-23e39b33dfd5","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Float64Array"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d9d2375e-f3f7-405d-854e-cd53bdf80eb5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"创建定型数组的一个办法同创建 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"DataView"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 一样，接收一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ArrayBuffer"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，以及 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"byteOffset"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"byteLength"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 两个可选参数"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"5c672c4b-cf30-4347-bee5-164e6ee46b10","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"143aff4e-56f0-42a4-9fb8-4bb3ab16464c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const buffer = new ArrayBuffer(10);\nconst int8 = new Int8Array(buffer, 1, 2);\n\nconsole.log(int8.buffer === buffer); // true\nconsole.log(int8.byteOffset); // 1\nconsole.log(int8.byteLength); // 2\nconsole.log(int8); // Int8Array(2) [ 0, 0 ]","collabId":"fb0bc64d-1d3e-49ba-a8dd-5b4bd4a897cc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2d206091-4482-4c83-a427-1b78d6a77c9b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不同的是，定型数组会对传入的参数进行校验，规则是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"byteLength"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 必须能够整除定型数组表示的元素大小，假如向 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Int16Array"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 传入一个大小为奇数的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"byteLength"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么会报错，因为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Int16Array"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中每个元素占据两个字节，而奇数不能整除 2，即无法平均分配，所以会报错"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"bea6da59-29a3-4f91-8b79-8edfbe19db0f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"611ec2d7-f80d-4769-a643-b84d36e25020","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const int16 = new Int16Array(buffer, 0, 9); // 9 不能整除 2，会报错","collabId":"a7341171-e1c5-49c5-897c-bd32cca5c1b1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e99b9b1a-b9c0-469c-be35-9ab722be86f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除此以外，还可以直接传入一个数字，表示分配多少"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"字节"},{"type":"formatted","text":"的内存给定型数组，同理需要注意传入的数字要能够整除定型数组中元素大小"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"257f1216-07bf-460a-88ec-47373728a0cc","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"bb03c6f1-85d7-409c-b0f4-cba88ad85034","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const int16 = new Int16Array(8);","collabId":"edb7f52a-26e2-4921-bcfc-050a400dbeda","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"danger","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"e2211bdf-2742-449d-b69e-9806d155065e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2898d84f-26d6-4e23-84b8-f07e9182ab4f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果没有向构造函数传入任何参数时，默认传入的参数为 0，这时定型数组不能保存数据，因为没有为它分配内存空间。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6d34e7cd-9651-446a-9ab8-4dd99d8ca6ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除此以外，定型数组的构造函数还可以接收如下几种类型的参数："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"cd346f9f-9de5-4636-be6a-09d8cdf81106","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4439b968-6491-44c4-ae60-221a807b9075","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"38d73fb8-2916-4eb2-89ca-46b7f7629ce7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个定型数组：将定型数组中的元素一个个的复制到新的定型数组中，所以"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"两个定型数组的 "},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"code":true,"text":"buffer"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":" 是不同的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6a187169-1b2d-4041-b200-3e9958b1d4e1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"63b14d8a-ac81-4c3b-9894-5eb045cc49c2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个可迭代的对象：调用对象的默认迭代器，将得到的元素一个个的添加到定型数组中"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ecd0f49a-40d0-4a92-992a-d032ceb54947","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6e7a2018-3afa-4509-a0cd-040d280af8ef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个数组"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"cb48c507-4a38-459b-a352-d9f327b57dba","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9092a61d-f47b-43eb-ac34-d61f008aee2a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个类数组，如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"arguments"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"7c7fdd22-7cd8-44bf-83c5-4366e5fe7349","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"7c260f3a-60fd-419c-ae62-d73905a32afe","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a0836